br /> <br /> Not going to say that they all pursued this goal faithfully, or that they were crying at the thought of the grevious harm they had to inflict to achieve it, but they felt less... like a Saturday morning cartoon villain with such an endgame plan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-26T18:32:16-07:00","id":730645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/684732-books-of-the-wyrm-1st-edition-through-w20?p=730535#post730535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To create a world where Humanity controls the world rather then being controlled by it.<br /> <br /> Not going to say that they all pursued this goal faithfully, or that they were crying at the thought of the grevious harm they had to inflict to achieve it, but they felt less... like a Saturday morning cartoon villain with such an endgame plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that version more as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-26T19:23:32-07:00","id":730768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/684732-books-of-the-wyrm-1st-edition-through-w20?p=730535#post730535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To create a world where Humanity controls the world rather then being controlled by it.<br /> <br /> Not going to say that they all pursued this goal faithfully, or that they were crying at the thought of the grevious harm they had to inflict to achieve it, but they felt less... like a Saturday morning cartoon villain with such an endgame plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's funny. because the story given is exactly what I'd expect a Saturday morning cartoon antagonist to claim. Also, it's not really that noble a goal, or quite so much of a legitimate struggle. As for why it happened, bits of that actual message might have been commandeered by the Technocracy in the post-Haight distancing of each game from the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-26T19:44:23-07:00","id":730858,"title":"","content":"The 1st edition is also the one with Pentex preparing a space station so that the chosen could escape the hell they prepared to unleash on Earth.<br /> I don't think Pentex was particularly more noble in the older editions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T01:39:43-07:00","id":731682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/684732-books-of-the-wyrm-1st-edition-through-w20?p=730535#post730535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To create a world where Humanity controls the world rather then being controlled by it.<br /> <br /> Not going to say that they all pursued this goal faithfully, or that they were crying at the thought of the grevious harm they had to inflict to achieve it, but they felt less... like a Saturday morning cartoon villain with such an endgame plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>You do realise that same endgame plan actually ends with everything horribly murdered and Pentex delivering Humanity to the Wyrm? It totally sounds like what Miles Mayhem would have to say to justify his crap.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T02:31:08-07:00","id":731791,"title":"","content":"I know in my chapter of W20 <b>Book of the Wyrm</b>, I tried to stress a Pentex that is downright terrifying, not cartoony. Magnify all the most horrible things people do in real life, the sheer chaos of broken systems, political decay, rampant environmental devastation, with many perpetrators unaware of their true role. A great many\u2014perhaps most\u2014employees of Pentex subsidiaries don't realize exactly what they're doing. They're cutting corners, they're doing illegal things, they're making moral compromises, but they don't know that it's all killing the world and feeding a cosmic force of corruption. The ones who do aren't mustache-twirling Snidely Whiplashes. They're CEOs who value a .87% stock increase more than your baby's life. They smoke cigars obtained at great cost in foreign countries, satisfy debased urges in celebration of the latest economical conquest, they happily oppose environmental protection laws and cut every corner they can. <i>Because </i>they can. If the soul-crushing daily grind doesn't break your spirit, the monsters in the night eventually will. These are people who sell their soul, then buy stock in the possessing entity.<br /> <br /> They're evil in the most terrifying (and sadly all too realistic) ways. For them, for the &quot;wolves&quot; of industry, the true shepherds of humanity's best and brightest, it's not about destroying the world. It's about getting what you want, <i>when </i>you want it, everyone else be damned. Today you've got yours, and tomorrow you'll get <i>theirs</i>, too. A few probably wouldn't <i>want </i>the world destroyed, since they're part of it, too. Some are probably too far gone to care. Money, vice, sheer indulgence, or economic predation, it's all a means to an end.<br /> <br /> The ones at the bottom usually have <i>no </i>clue what they're doing. Loggers cutting down rainforests might be well aware of what they're doing, or they might just be trying to keep a family fed\u2014or both. You kill them, the planet suffers just that much more, anyway, as you bring more misery into the world. Board members at the top just laugh and hire more expendable assets. The Garou are no closer to victory; in fact, they're further away than before, slaying the people who might be able to help if they come around to Gaia's side.<br /> <br /> The human world is broken. It is decaying. In its death throes it will drag Earth and Gaia down into the grave. Destroying humanity all but seals the Garou's fate, if it could even be done. Like weeds, corruption from the mundane to the spiritual have their roots in deep, and ripping them out seems almost impossible. Pentex thrives at the heart of this sickness, and it would even if the Wyrm did nothing\u2014the worst of human nature leads to this disease. Only the best of human nature can help fight it. But most Garou don't want that, don't understand that, and time is running out.<br /> <br /> Impossible? Maybe. But the Garou stare impossible odds and overwhelming evil and they do not flinch. Pentex is a hydra of a million heads. Find one, cut it off, and another may grow back. Well, say the Garou...<br /> <br /> ...that just gives us another one to cut off!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T05:42:30-07:00","id":731984,"title":"","content":"Thanks for reminding us all that Pentex is really not something to be treated lightly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T13:39:58-07:00","id":735687,"title":"","content":"oh was reading about what a BADASS Zhyzak is... curious what happens if the garou nation manages to destroy her, how bad a morale blow would it be to the Fallen tribe? <br /> <br /> especialy as now she can never &quot;Slay the last Gaian king&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}